From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: port <port@local>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 15:45:12 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] core: delete the Mono runtime

BepInEx ships two runtime backends: the Mono one (BepInEx.Unity.Mono and
BepInEx.Unity.Mono.Preloader) and the IL2CPP one. A Unity IL2CPP game embeds
neither Mono nor BepInEx's own UnityEngine bindings, so the Mono projects are
dead weight that only exists to be compiled and shipped.

Removing them also removes the entrypoint patcher, the TraceFix/XTermFix/
UnityPatches runtime fixes and the BaseUnityPlugin/UnityChainloader plumbing
that cannot run on Android.
